          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ограбление (ograbléniye) is built on ограбить, the perfective of грабить (grábit) \"to rob\", which is inherited from Proto-Slavic grabiti (EtymDB)."
            }
          ]
        },
